 scan/brute-force, thong ke traffic va User-Agent, chan/go chan IP, va ve bieu
 do theo ngay/thang (duong, nen OHLC, cot) ngay tren WebUI nhe khong CDN.
 .
 Ho tro real-IP Cloudflare: khong bao gio ban dai IP Cloudflare (tranh sap
 toan bo site), uu tien CF-Connecting-IP/X-Forwarded-For khi log co ghi.
 Dashboard bind 127.0.0.1 (vao qua SSH tunnel). Tich hop notifier
